{"id":"BSEN.TA","updated":"2026-11-09","currency":"USD","info":{"sharesOutstanding":9549913,"beta":0.431,"fullTimeEmployees":1383,"website":"https://bsel.co.il","longBusinessSummary":"Bet Shemesh Engines Holdings (1997) Ltd, together with its subsidiaries, produces and sells jet engine parts in Israel, North America, Europe, Asia, South America, Africa, and internationally. It operates through Manufacturing of Parts and Engines segments. The company offers jet engine complex parts, such as compressor and turbine disks and blisks, frames, cases, air seals, spacers, turbine nozzles, and turbine blades; sheet metal parts and combustion chambers; and augmentor seals, flaps, and flame holders. It also provides torque frames, discs, gears, rotating seals, bearing housings, cases, rings, rotors, flanges, hubs, impellers, and stub shafts produced by closed-die forgings and rolled seamless rings; and air foils, structural parts for the engines, integral compressors and turbine wheels, gas turbine engine hot parts, and air valves for aircraft environmental control systems. In addition, the company offers repair, overhaul, and engineering services to complete engines, as well as modules, and engine components and accessories; and field services comprising troubleshooting and HSI on-wing services for aircraft and helicopters. Further, it engages in the design of gas turbine engines, modules, and parts; development, customization, and manufacture of a range of gas turbine engines; and provision of general technical support and services, including design, integration support, and customization for specific applications. The company exports its products. It serves the civilian and military aviation markets. Bet Shemesh Engines Holdings (1997) Ltd was incorporated in 1997 and is based in Beit Shemesh, Israel.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","financialCurrency":"USD","currency":"ILS","country":"Israel","city":"Beit Shemesh","trailingEps":18.98,"profitMargins